From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Caner Altinbasak <cal@brightsign.biz>
Date: Tue, 29 Jul 2025 19:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix: Add missing IS_OZONE_X11 buildflag for Electron

Electron source code references BUILDFLAG(IS_OZONE_X11) in several
files but the buildflag is not defined in the ozone_buildflags
header. Add it alongside the existing SUPPORTS_OZONE_X11 flag.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [OE-specific]
---
 ui/base/BUILD.gn | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

--- a/ui/base/BUILD.gn	2026-04-27 18:57:50.501975964 +0100
+++ b/ui/base/BUILD.gn	2026-04-27 18:57:50.509975900 +0100
@@ -1439,5 +1439,6 @@
   flags = [
     "SUPPORTS_OZONE_WAYLAND=$ozone_platform_wayland",
     "SUPPORTS_OZONE_X11=$ozone_platform_x11",
+    "IS_OZONE_X11=$ozone_platform_x11",
   ]
 }
-- 
2.39.5
